</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 07, 2005 - 10:16 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->TOM: Thanks for the compliment. I think. There&#39;s no &#34;devious reason&#34; for me starting this &#34;TALKING TO TOM&#34; thread here. And from the looks of it, it could be a very good thread. <BR> <BR>I just thought it would help you &amp; the public in general. However, if you are thinking of possible favors, well, let me give that some thought... &#40;Just joking!&#41; <BR> <BR>Victor <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
