</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 10, 2005 - 7:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->TOM &amp; all who are going to Wichita: Hope the trip is shaping up great. Unfortunately I just got some horrible financial news &#40;IRS&#41; so I won&#39;t be going. <BR>    <BR>But I&#39;m really looking forward to hearing details about how it goes. I&#39;ll be with you in spirit, though. Find some good night life and... <BR> <BR>   &#34;CATCH BTK&#34;! <BR> <BR>   And Have a Great Time! <BR> <BR>   Victor<!--/Text--></td></tr>
